[{"id":"CN-ROADMAP-001","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["入门路线","学习顺序"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/347ce4f2/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/347ce4f2/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么课程文章要按依赖顺序逐篇完成，而不是一次公开全部占位内容？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>因为每篇正文都必须同时完成前置概念、图表、可复现实验、失败边界和闪卡校验，未完成的占位文章不能冒充可学习正文。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>课程先用入门路线固定顺序，再逐篇通过公开候选门禁。这样可以避免后续文章引用尚未解释的概念，也能让 Mermaid、实验命令和面试闪卡在公开前得到真实构建验证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-fill-type","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["表单","输入"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>fill()\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>press_sequentially()\u003c/code> 的主要区别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>fill()\u003c/code> 设置完整值，\u003ccode>press_sequentially()\u003c/code> 逐键触发键盘事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>普通文本输入优先使用 \u003ccode>fill()\u003c/code>；只有搜索建议、输入掩码或逐键事件属于产品合同，才需要逐键输入。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]